.Dd August 8, 2026
.Dt LIBSECDB 3LIB
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm libsecdb
.Nd security attributes database library
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libsecdb
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In secdb.h
.In user_attr.h
.In prof_attr.h
.In exec_attr.h
.In auth_attr.h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Functions in this library provide routines for manipulation of security
attribute databases.
.Sh INTERFACES
The shared object
.Pa libsecdb.so.1
provides the public interfaces defined below.
See
.Xr Intro 3
for additional information on shared object interfaces.
.Bl -column -offset 4n chkauthattr_ucred chkauthattr_ucred chkauthattr_ucred
.It chkauthattr Ta chkauthattr_flags Ta chkauthattr_ucred
.It endauthattr Ta endexecattr Ta endprofattr
.It enduserattr Ta fgetuserattr Ta free_authattr
.It free_execattr Ta free_profattr Ta free_proflist
.It free_userattr Ta getauthattr Ta getauthnam
.It getexecattr Ta getexecprof Ta getexecuser
.It getprofattr Ta getproflist Ta getprofnam
.It getuserattr Ta getusernam Ta getuseruid
.It kva_match Ta match_execattr Ta setauthattr
.It setexecattr Ta setprofattr Ta setuserattr
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /lib/64/libsecdb.so.1
.It Pa /lib/libsecdb.so.1
shared object
.It Pa /lib/64/libsecdb.so.1
64-bit shared object
.El
.Sh MT-LEVEL
.Sy MT-Safe
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr Intro 3 ,
.Xr attributes 7
